{"id":"u-8e7100d1-c296-4d11-ac11-79ac23a68fc5","src":"community","title":"PHAT - Candy V4","author":"Justin M","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TMAf2D-phat-candy-v3-1","desc":"I ran the original PHAT program for about 1.5 years and made great overall progress, but my shoulders, arms, and glutes lagged behind. To target those areas more directly, I created Candy Version 1 and ran it for 12 weeks. It worked, but the volume was high and led to arm and elbow irritation.\n\nCandy Version 2 keeps the PHAT framework but cuts redundant movements, tightens rep ranges, and focuses on high-quality hypertrophy work. The goal is simple: prioritize glutes and shoulders, grow arms without joint pain, and keep workouts efficient.\n\nCandy version 3 will just hit arms a little more and sub in a couple different exercises.\n\nThe number 4 version swaps day 3 and 5 so that I dont have two push days next to eachother. other minor tweaks \n\nPHAT-style routine that emphasizes glutes, shoulders, and arms with smarter, cleaner volume.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-27T23:18:04.638Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Power (Shoulder press)","Lower \"Power\" (Glute Focus)","Push Hypertrophy","Lower Body Hypertrophy","Back & Shoulders Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Wide grip"},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}],"note":"Optional"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press"